# ADR-0326 (TASK-27 9f-text): NetSurf's text through zoraya-text at scale 2, in
# a boot of its own (`make test-netsurf`'s second run; the first, at scale 1, is
# tests/gui/netsurf.script). Coordinates are logical pixels; the runner reads
# twice the pixels and wants an ink count four times as high. The page
# (/ns/cyrillic) is in points, so it is the same in logical pixels at both
# scales; NetSurf's toolbar keeps its pixel size, so the page starts 15 logical
# pixels higher than at scale 1.
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
pause 3000
type netsurf http://@HOST@:@PORT@/ns/cyrillic\r
pause 15000
shot netsurf-cyrillic-2
# Line 1, ten і: ink where they are, and nothing where ten ж reach on line 2;
# boxes or one cell width would make the two lines as wide (INV-0326-2).
ink 106 157 70 23 ffffff 300
region 190 157 140 23 ffffff
ink 190 199 140 17 ffffff 500
# Line 3: Ґґ Єє Іі Її.
ink 106 224 125 29 ffffff 400
click 122 119
pause 3000
click 300 87
pause 500
type echo closed\r
screen closed
type poweroff\r
exit
